@startuml
title FlightOS interrupt handling flow
skinparam linetype ortho

start
:Controller asserts an interrupt;
:SPARC trap table selects the interrupt entry;
:IRQ trap entry saves register state;
if (nested IRQ support enabled?) then (yes)
  :Set interrupt threshold for nesting;
else (no)
  :Raise threshold to block nesting;
endif
:SPARC backend identifies the interrupt domain;
:Walk registered handlers;
if (handler is immediate?) then (yes)
  :Run handler on interrupt path;
else (deferred)
  :Queue handler for deferred execution;
endif
if (task preemption configuration permits?) then (yes)
  :Allow scheduler handoff;
else (no)
endif
:Restore register state;
:Return to interrupted execution;
stop
@enduml
